Description:
    Regenerate all solution properties and dependent
    records for the application.

    This calls out to the following generators in addition to its own tasks:
    * `solution_property_definitions`
    * `schemas`

Example:
    bin/rails generate solution_properties

    This will create:
        app/services/solution_properties/free_inputs.rb
        app/services/solution_properties/has_implementations.rb
        app/services/solution_properties/has_store_model_lists.rb
